{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JNN4vmDppuTQS2Yb9htyqs","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 从 ''exception dominates'' 调整为 ''exception is sufficient\n2\t  and simplest — matching or exceeding VOTA with ~16x fewer tokens and no execution\n3\t  reasoning requirement.'' nomarker 结果正面转化: exception content itself carries fault\n4\t  signal, structural formatting optional. Claim 3 Tier 2 加 seed-dependent stability\n5\t  caveat. 1.5B 数据作 supplementary evidence。'\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: exception_only_nomarker_seed42\n8\t  plan_id: nomarker_ablation\n9\t  description: Qwen-7B exception_only 去除 [ERROR] format marker，保留 exception type+message\n10\t    内容\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    accuracy: 0.9933\n13\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9882\n14\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9975\n15\t    n: 1190\n16\t    pass_precision: 1.0\n17\t    pass_recall: 0.9906\n18\t    pass_f1: 0.9953\n19\t    fail_precision: 0.9769\n20\t    fail_recall: 1.0\n21\t    fail_f1: 0.9883\n22\t    errors: 8\n23\t    drop_vs_marker: 0.005\n24\t    train_loss: 0.115\n25\t  result_rationale: 在 median 档下，[ERROR] marker 不是 active ingredient。SFT 模型通过 exception\n26\t    content 的语义（type name + message 描述 fault 本质）学到 pass/fail mapping，而非依赖 [ERROR]\n27\t    关键字的 regex-like 检测。证据：regex baseline B1 ([ERROR] presence) 仅 93.45%，远低于 SFT 的\n28\t    99.83%——说明 SFT 学习的是 content 而非 marker。去除 marker 后 drop 仅 0.5pp（99.83→99.33%），8\n29\t    errors 与 DeepSeek seed42/456 完全一致（均 8/1190），暗示这些额外 errors 来自 borderline samples\n30\t    在没有格式化对齐辅助时的轻微混淆，但不改变核心能力。\n31\t  tables:\n32\t  - name: nomarker_vs_marker_comparison\n33\t    columns:\n34\t    - condition\n35\t    - accuracy\n36\t    - errors\n37\t    - drop_pp\n38\t    rows:\n39\t    - - exception_only (with marker)\n40\t      - 99.83%\n41\t      - 2\n42\t      - —\n43\t    - - exception_only_nomarker\n44\t      - 99.33%\n45\t      - 8\n46\t      - '-0.50'\n47\t  figures_description:\n48\t  - 'Bar chart: marker vs nomarker accuracy with 95% CI error bars, showing overlapping\n49\t    CIs'\n50\t  analysis: Drop 0.50pp 在统计上可能 borderline significant (McNemar p≈0.03-0.08)，但 practical\n51\t    significance 极小。支持论文叙事：'exception content itself carries the fault signal; structural\n52\t    formatting is optional, providing at most marginal alignment benefit.' 这比 'marker\n53\t    is required' 更 fundamental 的 claim。\n54\t- name: exception_only_nomarker_seed123\n55\t  plan_id: nomarker_ablation\n56\t  description: Qwen-7B nomarker seed123 复现\n57\t  expected_results:\n58\t    accuracy: 0.9916\n59\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9857\n60\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9966\n61\t    n: 1190\n62\t    errors: 10\n63\t    drop_vs_marker_seed123: 0.0067\n64\t    train_loss: 0.118\n65\t  result_rationale: Seed123 在有 marker 时 99.83%（2 errors，irreducible GeneratorExit）。去除\n66\t    marker 后，模型在没有 [ERROR] 格式对齐的情况下对 ~8 个额外 borderline samples（exception content 较模糊的\n67\t    shorter/generic error messages）产生误判。总 10 errors 中 2 个是 irreducible (GeneratorExit)，8\n68\t    个是 marker-removal 引入的 edge cases。Seed 间方差极小（±0.17pp），确认 nomarker 条件下 Qwen 7B 仍然\n69\t    seed-robust。\n70\t  tables: []\n71\t  figures_description: []\n72\t  analysis: 与 seed42 结果一致方向（drop ~0.5-0.7pp），3-seed 方差 <0.2pp 确认 nomarker 稳定性。\n73\t- name: exception_only_nomarker_seed456\n74\t  plan_id: nomarker_ablation\n75\t  description: Qwen-7B nomarker seed456 复现\n76\t  expected_results:\n77\t    accuracy: 0.995\n78\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9899\n79\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9992\n80\t    n: 1190\n81\t    errors: 6\n82\t    drop_vs_marker_seed456: 0.0033\n83\t    train_loss: 0.112\n84\t  result_rationale: Seed456 LoRA 初始化落入稍好的 basin，即使去除 marker 仍只有 6 errors（2 irreducible\n85\t    + 4 borderline）。不同 seed 对 marker removal 的敏感度有轻微差异（4-10 extra errors range），但总体\n86\t    pattern 一致：nomarker 条件在 99.0-99.5% 区间稳定。\n87\t  tables:\n88\t  - name: nomarker_3seed_summary\n89\t    columns:\n90\t    - seed\n91\t    - accuracy\n92\t    - errors\n93\t    - drop_vs_marker\n94\t    rows:\n95\t    - - 42\n96\t      - 99.33%\n97\t      - 8\n98\t      - -0.50pp\n99\t    - - 123\n100\t      - 99.16%\n101\t      - 10\n102\t      - -0.67pp\n103\t    - - 456\n104\t      - 99.50%\n105\t      - 6\n106\t      - -0.33pp\n107\t    - - mean±std\n108\t      - 99.33%±0.17\n109\t      - 8.0±2.0\n110\t      - -0.50±0.17pp\n111\t  figures_description:\n112\t  - 'Paired bar chart: 3 seeds × 2 conditions (marker/nomarker), with paired lines\n113\t    showing per-seed drop'\n114\t  analysis: '3-seed nomarker mean=99.33%（与 marker 99.83% 差 0.50pp），std=0.17pp（marker\n115\t    条件 std=0.00）。Marker removal 引入极小方差但不改变核心结论。McNemar 3-seed pooled: nomarker 仍显著优于\n116\t    VOTA (99.33% vs 99.41%, 但 CI 重叠)。正面叙事：''exception content 是 sufficient signal，formatting\n117\t    是 optional convenience''。'\n118\t- name: loop_only_seed123\n119\t  plan_id: plan_003\n120\t  description: Qwen-7B loop_only component seed123 复现\n121\t  expected_results:\n122\t    accuracy: 0.8118\n123\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7882\n124\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.8345\n125\t    n: 1190\n126\t    pass_precision: 0.896\n127\t    pass_recall: 0.838\n128\t    pass_f1: 0.866\n129\t    fail_precision: 0.649\n130\t    fail_recall: 0.748\n131\t    fail_f1: 0.695\n132\t    train_loss: 0.078\n133\t    drop_vs_seed42: -0.0445\n134\t  result_rationale: Loop compression 是 Tier 2 behavioral signal，需要模型理解循环执行模式（iteration\n135\t    counts, early termination）。与 Tier 1 exception signal（binary fault presence）不同，loop\n136\t    pattern 的学习对 LoRA 初始化更敏感。Seed123 落入较差的 basin，对 loop→verdict mapping 的 fail 类学习不充分（fail_recall\n137\t    从 seed42 的 82% 降至 ~75%）。4.5pp drop 对应 ~53 个额外 errors，主要集中在 loop 正常但代码实际有 non-loop-related\n138\t    bugs 的 samples（loop 信号无法区分）。这证实 Tier 2 信号的 model-dependent + seed-dependent 特性。\n139\t  tables: []\n140\t  figures_description: []\n141\t  analysis: Seed123 的 81.2% 仍显著高于 no_trace (75.13%, p<0.01)，但相对 seed42 (85.63%) drop\n142\t    4.5pp 说明 loop signal 的 learnability 方差较大。对比 exception_only seed123 仍是 99.83%——Tier\n143\t    1 vs Tier 2 的 seed robustness 差异鲜明。\n144\t- name: loop_only_seed456\n145\t  plan_id: plan_003\n146\t  description: Qwen-7B loop_only component seed456 复现\n147\t  expected_results:\n148\t    accuracy: 0.8807\n149\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.8613\n150\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.8992\n151\t    n: 1190\n152\t    pass_precision: 0.936\n153\t    pass_recall: 0.892\n154\t    pass_f1: 0.913\n155\t    fail_precision: 0.766\n156\t    fail_recall: 0.851\n157\t    fail_f1: 0.806\n158\t    train_loss: 0.069\n159\t    lift_vs_seed42: 0.0244\n160\t  result_rationale: Seed456 LoRA 初始化落入较好的 basin，loop→verdict mapping 学习更充分。Fail_recall\n161\t    从 seed42 的 82% 提升至 85%，加上 pass 类也有改善（+2pp recall）。总体 88.1% 是 loop_only 条件的 upper\n162\t    range，但仍远低于 exception_only (99.83%)，确认 Tier 2 信号即使在最好 seed 下也无法匹配 Tier 1。差异主要来源：loop\n163\t    compression 仅编码 behavioral pattern（iteration count, convergence），无法捕获 non-iterative\n164\t    failures (assertion errors, type errors, edge case bugs)。\n165\t  tables:\n166\t  - name: loop_only_3seed_summary\n167\t    columns:\n168\t    - seed\n169\t    - accuracy\n170\t    - fail_recall\n171\t    - interpretation\n172\t    rows:\n173\t    - - 42\n174\t      - 85.63%\n175\t      - 0.82\n176\t      - baseline\n177\t    - - 123\n178\t      - 81.18%\n179\t      - 0.748\n180\t      - LoRA 较差 basin\n181\t    - - 456\n182\t      - 88.07%\n183\t      - 0.851\n184\t      - LoRA 较好 basin\n185\t    - - mean±std\n186\t      - 84.96%±3.47\n187\t      - 0.806±0.053\n188\t      - Tier 2 seed-sensitive\n189\t  figures_description:\n190\t  - 'Violin plot: loop_only 3-seed distribution vs exception_only 3-seed distribution\n191\t    (后者为单点 99.83%)'\n192\t  - 'Error analysis: Venn diagram of errors across 3 seeds — showing low overlap (seed-specific\n193\t    failures)'\n194\t  analysis: 3-seed std=3.47pp（vs exception_only std=0.00pp）。这是 Claim 3 'Tier 2 seed-dependent\n195\t    stability' caveat 的核心证据。Range 81-88% 意味着 loop_only 的 usefulness 取决于 training luck，而\n196\t    exception_only 完全不依赖。论文措辞从 'robust behavioral signal' 弱化为 'useful but variable\n197\t    behavioral signal, fully subsumed by Tier 1 exception events.' 同时 loop_only mean\n198\t    (84.96%) ≈ full_trace_label_only (86.22%)，确认 VOTA loop compression 精确提取 full trace\n199\t    中的 useful behavioral subset。\n200\t- name: qwen15b_vota_seed42\n201\t  plan_id: plan_1.5b_scaling\n202\t  description: Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B VOTA SFT\n203\t  expected_results:\n204\t    accuracy: 0.9697\n205\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9596\n206\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.979\n207\t    n: 1190\n208\t    pass_precision: 0.978\n209\t    pass_recall: 0.982\n210\t    pass_f1: 0.98\n211\t    fail_precision: 0.945\n212\t    fail_recall: 0.937\n213\t    fail_f1: 0.941\n214\t    train_loss: 0.065\n215\t    eval_loss: 0.12\n216\t    lift_vs_no_trace: 0.2966\n217\t    gap_vs_exception_only: -0.0286\n218\t  result_rationale: 1.5B 模型在 VOTA 条件下达 97.0%——远高于预期的 'small model struggles with trace\n219\t    reasoning' 叙事。原因：(1) VOTA trace 在此数据集上已经高度结构化（exception + ae + loop 三组件），1.5B\n220\t    有足够容量记忆这些 pattern；(2) 训练 3 epochs 在仅 4720 samples 上允许充分拟合；(3) max_length=2048\n221\t    对 1.5B VOTA 同样适用且 Qwen tokenizer 的 VOTA 样本大多在 2048 以内（Qwen 7B 无截断问题）。关键：exception_only\n222\t    已达 99.83%（与 7B 完全一致），VOTA gap 仅 2.86pp（vs 7B 的 0.42pp）——gap 存在但缩窄的方向反了。实际上是 VOTA\n223\t    在 1.5B 上降了（99.41→97.0%）而 exception 不降（99.83→99.83%），说明 VOTA 的 Tier 2 组件（loop compression）需要更多\n224\t    model capacity，而 exception signal 的 simplicity 让 1.5B 也能完美学习。\n225\t  tables:\n226\t  - name: qwen15b_condition_comparison\n227\t    columns:\n228\t    - condition\n229\t    - 1.5B accuracy\n230\t    - 7B accuracy\n231\t    - cross-scale gap\n232\t    rows:\n233\t    - - no_trace\n234\t      - 67.31%\n235\t      - 75.13%\n236\t      - -7.82pp\n237\t    - - VOTA\n238\t      - 97.0%\n239\t      - 99.41%\n240\t      - -2.41pp\n241\t    - - exception_only\n242\t      - 99.83%\n243\t      - 99.83%\n244\t      - 0.00pp\n245\t  figures_description:\n246\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 1.5B vs 7B across conditions, highlighting exception_only\n247\t    zero gap'\n248\t  - 'Line plot: model scale (x) vs accuracy (y) per condition — showing exception_only\n249\t    flat line, VOTA slight decrease, no_trace steeper decrease'\n250\t  analysis: '1.5B VOTA 97.0% 削弱了 ''exception dominates VOTA'' 的 accuracy gap claim（差距仅\n251\t    2.86pp，虽然 7B 上 exception 与 VOTA McNemar p=0.01，1.5B 上 p 可能更显著因为 gap 更大）。但反过来强化了\n252\t    efficiency + robustness angle: exception_only 在 1.5B 上与 7B 完全一致（99.83%），不受模型规模影响；VOTA\n253\t    在 1.5B 上降 2.4pp，说明其 Tier 2 组件的 model-capability dependency。Claim 1 pivot: ''exception\n254\t    is sufficient and simplest — achieving identical performance (99.83%) regardless\n255\t    of model scale, while VOTA performance degrades on smaller models.'' 这在 EMNLP\n256\t    是强 practical argument。'\n257\t- name: qwen15b_full_trace_seed42\n258\t  plan_id: plan_1.5b_scaling\n259\t  description: Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B full_trace SFT\n260\t  expected_results:\n261\t    accuracy: 0.7445\n262\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7193\n263\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.7689\n264\t    n: 1190\n265\t    pass_precision: 0.842\n266\t    pass_recall: 0.793\n267\t    pass_f1: 0.817\n268\t    fail_precision: 0.548\n269\t    fail_recall: 0.623\n270\t    fail_f1: 0.583\n271\t    train_loss: 0.062\n272\t    eval_loss: 0.095\n273\t    lift_vs_no_trace: 0.0714\n274\t  result_rationale: 1.5B full_trace 预计 74.5%（vs 7B 的 81.76%，drop 7.3pp）。较小模型在处理长 full\n275\t    trace（高噪声、信息过载）时能力更弱。但不会像 DeepSeek full_trace v1 那样完全坍塌，因为 Qwen tokenizer 对 full\n276\t    trace 的 token 化效率较好，label 不会被截断。74.5% 略高于 no_trace (67.31%)——full trace 仍提供 marginal\n277\t    benefit (+7.1pp)，但远低于 VOTA (97.0%) 和 exception_only (99.83%)。1.5B 上 information\n278\t    overload 问题更严重：模型容量小 → attention 被 noisy tokens 稀释更多 → gradient dilution + information\n279\t    overload 双重效应放大。\n280\t  tables:\n281\t  - name: information_density_scaling\n282\t    columns:\n283\t    - condition\n284\t    - 1.5B\n285\t    - 7B\n286\t    - gap\n287\t    - interpretation\n288\t    rows:\n289\t    - - no_trace\n290\t      - 67.31%\n291\t      - 75.13%\n292\t      - -7.82pp\n293\t      - baseline capability gap\n294\t    - - full_trace\n295\t      - 74.45%\n296\t      - 81.76%\n297\t      - -7.31pp\n298\t      - information overload scales with model size\n299\t    - - VOTA\n300\t      - 97.0%\n301\t      - 99.41%\n302\t      - -2.41pp\n303\t      - compressed trace partially compensates\n304\t    - - exception_only\n305\t      - 99.83%\n306\t      - 99.83%\n307\t      - 0.00pp\n308\t      - minimal signal immune to scale\n309\t  figures_description:\n310\t  - 'Heatmap: condition × model_size → accuracy, with color gradient showing scale\n311\t    sensitivity'\n312\t  analysis: Full_trace 在 1.5B 上仅 marginal improvement over no_trace (+7.1pp vs 7B\n313\t    的 +6.6pp)，information overload 在小模型上没有更严重（gap 保持 ~7pp），但 base capability 更低。关键对比：full_trace→exception_only\n314\t    lift 在 1.5B 上为 25.4pp（vs 7B 18.1pp），说明小模型从 signal extraction 中获益更多——进一步支持 'information\n315\t    density is the bottleneck, smaller models suffer more from it' 论点。这强化 Claim 2。\n316\t- name: codellama13b_exception_only_seed42\n317\t  plan_id: plan_3rd_model\n318\t  description: CodeLlama-13B-Instruct exception_only SFT\n319\t  expected_results:\n320\t    accuracy: 0.995\n321\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9907\n322\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9983\n323\t    n: 1190\n324\t    pass_precision: 1.0\n325\t    pass_recall: 0.993\n326\t    pass_f1: 0.996\n327\t    fail_precision: 0.985\n328\t    fail_recall: 1.0\n329\t    fail_f1: 0.992\n330\t    train_loss: 0.098\n331\t    errors: 6\n332\t  result_rationale: CodeLlama-13B 是 13B 参数模型（比 Qwen 7B/DeepSeek 6.7B 大约 2x），exception\n333\t    signal 的 structural simplicity 使其在更大模型上同样容易学习。预计 99.50%——略低于 Qwen 7B (99.83%)\n334\t    的 2 errors irreducible ceiling，因为 CodeLlama 的 chat template 和 tokenizer 与 Qwen\n335\t    不同，可能引入 2-4 个额外 borderline errors。但仍然是 near-perfect，远高于 VOTA 条件。6 errors 中 2 个是\n336\t    GeneratorExit irreducible，4 个是 tokenizer/template 差异导致的 edge cases。这作为第 3 个模型验证\n337\t    exception signal 的 cross-architecture robustness。\n338\t  tables: []\n339\t  figures_description: []\n340\t  analysis: 第 3 模型达 99.50% 将 effective_model_count 从 2 提升至 3（Qwen 99.83%, CodeLlama\n341\t    99.50%, DeepSeek 99.33% median）。exception_only 在 3 个架构不同的模型上均 >99%（最差情况排除 DeepSeek\n342\t    seed123 outlier），构成 strong cross-model evidence。\n343\t- name: codellama13b_no_trace_seed42\n344\t  plan_id: plan_3rd_model\n345\t  description: CodeLlama-13B-Instruct no_trace baseline\n346\t  expected_results:\n347\t    accuracy: 0.7622\n348\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7378\n349\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.7857\n350\t    n: 1190\n351\t    pass_precision: 0.864\n352\t    pass_recall: 0.79\n353\t    pass_f1: 0.826\n354\t    fail_precision: 0.578\n355\t    fail_recall: 0.694\n356\t    fail_f1: 0.631\n357\t    train_loss: 0.165\n358\t  result_rationale: CodeLlama-13B 的 no_trace baseline 预计 76.2%——介于 Qwen 7B (75.13%)\n359\t    和 DeepSeek (73.36%) 之间偏高。13B 参数量提供略多的 pre-trained knowledge (code pattern recognition\n360\t    from source code alone)，但没有 trace 信息时 ceiling 仍被 'guessing from code structure'\n361\t    限制。CodeLlama 虽然更大，但在 HumanEval/MBPP 这类 competitive programming 题目上其 base code\n362\t    understanding 不必然比 Qwen-7B-Coder (specialized for code) 强很多。Cross-model no_trace\n363\t    gap 维持在 ~2-3pp 范围内（73-76%），确认 baseline capability 跨模型一致。\n364\t  tables: []\n365\t  figures_description: []\n366\t  analysis: no_trace 76.2% 作为 CodeLlama 的 baseline，exception_only lift = 23.3pp（vs\n367\t    Qwen 24.7pp, DeepSeek 26.0pp）。跨模型 trace lift 一致性（23-26pp range）是 trace value 论证的重要支撑。\n368\t- name: codellama13b_vota_seed42\n369\t  plan_id: plan_3rd_model\n370\t  description: CodeLlama-13B-Instruct VOTA SFT\n371\t  expected_results:\n372\t    accuracy: 0.9244\n373\t    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9092\n374\t    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9387\n375\t    n: 1190\n376\t    pass_precision: 0.924\n377\t    pass_recall: 0.98\n378\t    pass_f1: 0.951\n379\t    fail_precision: 0.925\n380\t    fail_recall: 0.785\n381\t    fail_f1: 0.849\n382\t    train_loss: 0.058\n383\t    eval_loss: 0.098\n384\t    gap_vs_exception_only: -0.0706\n385\t  result_rationale: CodeLlama-13B VOTA 预计 92.4%——介于 Qwen (99.41%) 和 DeepSeek (84.45%)\n386\t    之间。CodeLlama 的 execution reasoning capability (CRUXEval-I ~45-48%, 介于 Qwen 56.5%\n387\t    和 DeepSeek 39% 之间) 决定了其 VOTA utilization 能力。此外需检查 CodeLlama tokenizer 对 VOTA trace\n388\t    的 token 化效率——如果存在部分截断（类似 DeepSeek），会进一步拉低。VOTA 在 CodeLlama 上 gap vs exception_only\n389\t    为 7.1pp，远大于 Qwen (0.42pp) 但小于 DeepSeek (14.9pp worst-case)。这符合 'VOTA effectiveness\n390\t    is model-capability-dependent, exception signal bypasses this dependency' 叙事。Fail_recall\n391\t    78.5% 反映对 loop compression 信息的利用不完全。\n392\t  tables:\n393\t  - name: 3model_vota_vs_exception_comparison\n394\t    columns:\n395\t    - model\n396\t    - exception_only\n397\t    - VOTA\n398\t    - gap\n399\t    - CRUXEval-I (est.)\n400\t    rows:\n401\t    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\n402\t      - 99.83%\n403\t      - 99.41%\n404\t      - 0.42pp\n405\t      - 56.5%\n406\t    - - CodeLlama-13B\n407\t      - 99.50%\n408\t      - 92.44%\n409\t      - 7.06pp\n410\t      - ~46%\n411\t    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n412\t      - 99.33%*\n413\t      - 84.45%\n414\t      - 14.88pp\n415\t      - 39.0%\n416\t  - name: cross_model_summary_all\n417\t    columns:\n418\t    - condition\n419\t    - Qwen-7B\n420\t    - Qwen-1.5B\n421\t    - CodeLlama-13B\n422\t    - DeepSeek-6.7B\n423\t    - cross-model std\n424\t    rows:\n425\t    - - exception_only\n426\t      - 99.83%\n427\t      - 99.83%\n428\t      - 99.50%\n429\t      - 99.33%†\n430\t      - 0.24pp\n431\t    - - VOTA\n432\t      - 99.41%\n433\t      - 97.0%\n434\t      - 92.44%\n435\t      - 84.45%\n436\t      - 6.56pp\n437\t    - - no_trace\n438\t      - 75.13%\n439\t      - 67.31%\n440\t      - 76.22%\n441\t      - 73.36%\n442\t      - 3.86pp\n443\t  figures_description:\n444\t  - 'Scatter plot: CRUXEval-I score (x) vs VOTA accuracy (y) with regression line\n445\t    — showing correlation, but exception_only as horizontal line at ~99.5%'\n446\t  - 'Radar chart: 4 models × 3 conditions, showing exception_only''s uniform near-ceiling\n447\t    performance'\n448\t  analysis: CodeLlama VOTA 92.4% 提供了 CRUXEval-VOTA 相关性假说的第 3 个数据点（N=3 仍不足以 claim causation，但\n449\t    trend 一致：execution reasoning 越强 → VOTA 利用越好）。关键：exception_only cross-model std\n450\t    = 0.24pp vs VOTA cross-model std = 6.56pp (27x ratio)。这是论文最强的定量 evidence for 'exception\n451\t    signal is the most robust component'。Exception 对 model capability 几乎完全 invariant（99.3-99.8%），而\n452\t    VOTA 高度 model-dependent（84-99%）。Models_where_exception > VOTA = 3/3 (4/4 if count\n453\t    1.5B)。\n454\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"147aa667-950f-4e37-b30a-fd8f70c711f8","uuid":"c399f10b-0d86-4734-b824-fe988327c7d4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T11:24:35.970Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T105259/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 从 ''exception dominates'' 调整为 ''exception is sufficient\n  and simplest — matching or exceeding VOTA with ~16x fewer tokens and no execution\n  reasoning requirement.'' nomarker 结果正面转化: exception content itself carries fault\n  signal, structural formatting optional. Claim 3 Tier 2 加 seed-dependent stability\n  caveat. 1.5B 数据作 supplementary evidence。'\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: exception_only_nomarker_seed42\n  plan_id: nomarker_ablation\n  description: Qwen-7B exception_only 去除 [ERROR] format marker，保留 exception type+message\n    内容\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.9933\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9882\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9975\n    n: 1190\n    pass_precision: 1.0\n    pass_recall: 0.9906\n    pass_f1: 0.9953\n    fail_precision: 0.9769\n    fail_recall: 1.0\n    fail_f1: 0.9883\n    errors: 8\n    drop_vs_marker: 0.005\n    train_loss: 0.115\n  result_rationale: 在 median 档下，[ERROR] marker 不是 active ingredient。SFT 模型通过 exception\n    content 的语义（type name + message 描述 fault 本质）学到 pass/fail mapping，而非依赖 [ERROR]\n    关键字的 regex-like 检测。证据：regex baseline B1 ([ERROR] presence) 仅 93.45%，远低于 SFT 的\n    99.83%——说明 SFT 学习的是 content 而非 marker。去除 marker 后 drop 仅 0.5pp（99.83→99.33%），8\n    errors 与 DeepSeek seed42/456 完全一致（均 8/1190），暗示这些额外 errors 来自 borderline samples\n    在没有格式化对齐辅助时的轻微混淆，但不改变核心能力。\n  tables:\n  - name: nomarker_vs_marker_comparison\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - accuracy\n    - errors\n    - drop_pp\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only (with marker)\n      - 99.83%\n      - 2\n      - —\n    - - exception_only_nomarker\n      - 99.33%\n      - 8\n      - '-0.50'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: marker vs nomarker accuracy with 95% CI error bars, showing overlapping\n    CIs'\n  analysis: Drop 0.50pp 在统计上可能 borderline significant (McNemar p≈0.03-0.08)，但 practical\n    significance 极小。支持论文叙事：'exception content itself carries the fault signal; structural\n    formatting is optional, providing at most marginal alignment benefit.' 这比 'marker\n    is required' 更 fundamental 的 claim。\n- name: exception_only_nomarker_seed123\n  plan_id: nomarker_ablation\n  description: Qwen-7B nomarker seed123 复现\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.9916\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9857\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9966\n    n: 1190\n    errors: 10\n    drop_vs_marker_seed123: 0.0067\n    train_loss: 0.118\n  result_rationale: Seed123 在有 marker 时 99.83%（2 errors，irreducible GeneratorExit）。去除\n    marker 后，模型在没有 [ERROR] 格式对齐的情况下对 ~8 个额外 borderline samples（exception content 较模糊的\n    shorter/generic error messages）产生误判。总 10 errors 中 2 个是 irreducible (GeneratorExit)，8\n    个是 marker-removal 引入的 edge cases。Seed 间方差极小（±0.17pp），确认 nomarker 条件下 Qwen 7B 仍然\n    seed-robust。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 与 seed42 结果一致方向（drop ~0.5-0.7pp），3-seed 方差 <0.2pp 确认 nomarker 稳定性。\n- name: exception_only_nomarker_seed456\n  plan_id: nomarker_ablation\n  description: Qwen-7B nomarker seed456 复现\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.995\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9899\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9992\n    n: 1190\n    errors: 6\n    drop_vs_marker_seed456: 0.0033\n    train_loss: 0.112\n  result_rationale: Seed456 LoRA 初始化落入稍好的 basin，即使去除 marker 仍只有 6 errors（2 irreducible\n    + 4 borderline）。不同 seed 对 marker removal 的敏感度有轻微差异（4-10 extra errors range），但总体\n    pattern 一致：nomarker 条件在 99.0-99.5% 区间稳定。\n  tables:\n  - name: nomarker_3seed_summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - accuracy\n    - errors\n    - drop_vs_marker\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - 99.33%\n      - 8\n      - -0.50pp\n    - - 123\n      - 99.16%\n      - 10\n      - -0.67pp\n    - - 456\n      - 99.50%\n      - 6\n      - -0.33pp\n    - - mean±std\n      - 99.33%±0.17\n      - 8.0±2.0\n      - -0.50±0.17pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: 3 seeds × 2 conditions (marker/nomarker), with paired lines\n    showing per-seed drop'\n  analysis: '3-seed nomarker mean=99.33%（与 marker 99.83% 差 0.50pp），std=0.17pp（marker\n    条件 std=0.00）。Marker removal 引入极小方差但不改变核心结论。McNemar 3-seed pooled: nomarker 仍显著优于\n    VOTA (99.33% vs 99.41%, 但 CI 重叠)。正面叙事：''exception content 是 sufficient signal，formatting\n    是 optional convenience''。'\n- name: loop_only_seed123\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: Qwen-7B loop_only component seed123 复现\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.8118\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7882\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.8345\n    n: 1190\n    pass_precision: 0.896\n    pass_recall: 0.838\n    pass_f1: 0.866\n    fail_precision: 0.649\n    fail_recall: 0.748\n    fail_f1: 0.695\n    train_loss: 0.078\n    drop_vs_seed42: -0.0445\n  result_rationale: Loop compression 是 Tier 2 behavioral signal，需要模型理解循环执行模式（iteration\n    counts, early termination）。与 Tier 1 exception signal（binary fault presence）不同，loop\n    pattern 的学习对 LoRA 初始化更敏感。Seed123 落入较差的 basin，对 loop→verdict mapping 的 fail 类学习不充分（fail_recall\n    从 seed42 的 82% 降至 ~75%）。4.5pp drop 对应 ~53 个额外 errors，主要集中在 loop 正常但代码实际有 non-loop-related\n    bugs 的 samples（loop 信号无法区分）。这证实 Tier 2 信号的 model-dependent + seed-dependent 特性。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Seed123 的 81.2% 仍显著高于 no_trace (75.13%, p<0.01)，但相对 seed42 (85.63%) drop\n    4.5pp 说明 loop signal 的 learnability 方差较大。对比 exception_only seed123 仍是 99.83%——Tier\n    1 vs Tier 2 的 seed robustness 差异鲜明。\n- name: loop_only_seed456\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: Qwen-7B loop_only component seed456 复现\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.8807\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.8613\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.8992\n    n: 1190\n    pass_precision: 0.936\n    pass_recall: 0.892\n    pass_f1: 0.913\n    fail_precision: 0.766\n    fail_recall: 0.851\n    fail_f1: 0.806\n    train_loss: 0.069\n    lift_vs_seed42: 0.0244\n  result_rationale: Seed456 LoRA 初始化落入较好的 basin，loop→verdict mapping 学习更充分。Fail_recall\n    从 seed42 的 82% 提升至 85%，加上 pass 类也有改善（+2pp recall）。总体 88.1% 是 loop_only 条件的 upper\n    range，但仍远低于 exception_only (99.83%)，确认 Tier 2 信号即使在最好 seed 下也无法匹配 Tier 1。差异主要来源：loop\n    compression 仅编码 behavioral pattern（iteration count, convergence），无法捕获 non-iterative\n    failures (assertion errors, type errors, edge case bugs)。\n  tables:\n  - name: loop_only_3seed_summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - accuracy\n    - fail_recall\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - 85.63%\n      - 0.82\n      - baseline\n    - - 123\n      - 81.18%\n      - 0.748\n      - LoRA 较差 basin\n    - - 456\n      - 88.07%\n      - 0.851\n      - LoRA 较好 basin\n    - - mean±std\n      - 84.96%±3.47\n      - 0.806±0.053\n      - Tier 2 seed-sensitive\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Violin plot: loop_only 3-seed distribution vs exception_only 3-seed distribution\n    (后者为单点 99.83%)'\n  - 'Error analysis: Venn diagram of errors across 3 seeds — showing low overlap (seed-specific\n    failures)'\n  analysis: 3-seed std=3.47pp（vs exception_only std=0.00pp）。这是 Claim 3 'Tier 2 seed-dependent\n    stability' caveat 的核心证据。Range 81-88% 意味着 loop_only 的 usefulness 取决于 training luck，而\n    exception_only 完全不依赖。论文措辞从 'robust behavioral signal' 弱化为 'useful but variable\n    behavioral signal, fully subsumed by Tier 1 exception events.' 同时 loop_only mean\n    (84.96%) ≈ full_trace_label_only (86.22%)，确认 VOTA loop compression 精确提取 full trace\n    中的 useful behavioral subset。\n- name: qwen15b_vota_seed42\n  plan_id: plan_1.5b_scaling\n  description: Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B VOTA SFT\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.9697\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9596\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.979\n    n: 1190\n    pass_precision: 0.978\n    pass_recall: 0.982\n    pass_f1: 0.98\n    fail_precision: 0.945\n    fail_recall: 0.937\n    fail_f1: 0.941\n    train_loss: 0.065\n    eval_loss: 0.12\n    lift_vs_no_trace: 0.2966\n    gap_vs_exception_only: -0.0286\n  result_rationale: 1.5B 模型在 VOTA 条件下达 97.0%——远高于预期的 'small model struggles with trace\n    reasoning' 叙事。原因：(1) VOTA trace 在此数据集上已经高度结构化（exception + ae + loop 三组件），1.5B\n    有足够容量记忆这些 pattern；(2) 训练 3 epochs 在仅 4720 samples 上允许充分拟合；(3) max_length=2048\n    对 1.5B VOTA 同样适用且 Qwen tokenizer 的 VOTA 样本大多在 2048 以内（Qwen 7B 无截断问题）。关键：exception_only\n    已达 99.83%（与 7B 完全一致），VOTA gap 仅 2.86pp（vs 7B 的 0.42pp）——gap 存在但缩窄的方向反了。实际上是 VOTA\n    在 1.5B 上降了（99.41→97.0%）而 exception 不降（99.83→99.83%），说明 VOTA 的 Tier 2 组件（loop compression）需要更多\n    model capacity，而 exception signal 的 simplicity 让 1.5B 也能完美学习。\n  tables:\n  - name: qwen15b_condition_comparison\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - 1.5B accuracy\n    - 7B accuracy\n    - cross-scale gap\n    rows:\n    - - no_trace\n      - 67.31%\n      - 75.13%\n      - -7.82pp\n    - - VOTA\n      - 97.0%\n      - 99.41%\n      - -2.41pp\n    - - exception_only\n      - 99.83%\n      - 99.83%\n      - 0.00pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 1.5B vs 7B across conditions, highlighting exception_only\n    zero gap'\n  - 'Line plot: model scale (x) vs accuracy (y) per condition — showing exception_only\n    flat line, VOTA slight decrease, no_trace steeper decrease'\n  analysis: '1.5B VOTA 97.0% 削弱了 ''exception dominates VOTA'' 的 accuracy gap claim（差距仅\n    2.86pp，虽然 7B 上 exception 与 VOTA McNemar p=0.01，1.5B 上 p 可能更显著因为 gap 更大）。但反过来强化了\n    efficiency + robustness angle: exception_only 在 1.5B 上与 7B 完全一致（99.83%），不受模型规模影响；VOTA\n    在 1.5B 上降 2.4pp，说明其 Tier 2 组件的 model-capability dependency。Claim 1 pivot: ''exception\n    is sufficient and simplest — achieving identical performance (99.83%) regardless\n    of model scale, while VOTA performance degrades on smaller models.'' 这在 EMNLP\n    是强 practical argument。'\n- name: qwen15b_full_trace_seed42\n  plan_id: plan_1.5b_scaling\n  description: Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B full_trace SFT\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.7445\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7193\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.7689\n    n: 1190\n    pass_precision: 0.842\n    pass_recall: 0.793\n    pass_f1: 0.817\n    fail_precision: 0.548\n    fail_recall: 0.623\n    fail_f1: 0.583\n    train_loss: 0.062\n    eval_loss: 0.095\n    lift_vs_no_trace: 0.0714\n  result_rationale: 1.5B full_trace 预计 74.5%（vs 7B 的 81.76%，drop 7.3pp）。较小模型在处理长 full\n    trace（高噪声、信息过载）时能力更弱。但不会像 DeepSeek full_trace v1 那样完全坍塌，因为 Qwen tokenizer 对 full\n    trace 的 token 化效率较好，label 不会被截断。74.5% 略高于 no_trace (67.31%)——full trace 仍提供 marginal\n    benefit (+7.1pp)，但远低于 VOTA (97.0%) 和 exception_only (99.83%)。1.5B 上 information\n    overload 问题更严重：模型容量小 → attention 被 noisy tokens 稀释更多 → gradient dilution + information\n    overload 双重效应放大。\n  tables:\n  - name: information_density_scaling\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - 1.5B\n    - 7B\n    - gap\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - no_trace\n      - 67.31%\n      - 75.13%\n      - -7.82pp\n      - baseline capability gap\n    - - full_trace\n      - 74.45%\n      - 81.76%\n      - -7.31pp\n      - information overload scales with model size\n    - - VOTA\n      - 97.0%\n      - 99.41%\n      - -2.41pp\n      - compressed trace partially compensates\n    - - exception_only\n      - 99.83%\n      - 99.83%\n      - 0.00pp\n      - minimal signal immune to scale\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: condition × model_size → accuracy, with color gradient showing scale\n    sensitivity'\n  analysis: Full_trace 在 1.5B 上仅 marginal improvement over no_trace (+7.1pp vs 7B\n    的 +6.6pp)，information overload 在小模型上没有更严重（gap 保持 ~7pp），但 base capability 更低。关键对比：full_trace→exception_only\n    lift 在 1.5B 上为 25.4pp（vs 7B 18.1pp），说明小模型从 signal extraction 中获益更多——进一步支持 'information\n    density is the bottleneck, smaller models suffer more from it' 论点。这强化 Claim 2。\n- name: codellama13b_exception_only_seed42\n  plan_id: plan_3rd_model\n  description: CodeLlama-13B-Instruct exception_only SFT\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.995\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9907\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9983\n    n: 1190\n    pass_precision: 1.0\n    pass_recall: 0.993\n    pass_f1: 0.996\n    fail_precision: 0.985\n    fail_recall: 1.0\n    fail_f1: 0.992\n    train_loss: 0.098\n    errors: 6\n  result_rationale: CodeLlama-13B 是 13B 参数模型（比 Qwen 7B/DeepSeek 6.7B 大约 2x），exception\n    signal 的 structural simplicity 使其在更大模型上同样容易学习。预计 99.50%——略低于 Qwen 7B (99.83%)\n    的 2 errors irreducible ceiling，因为 CodeLlama 的 chat template 和 tokenizer 与 Qwen\n    不同，可能引入 2-4 个额外 borderline errors。但仍然是 near-perfect，远高于 VOTA 条件。6 errors 中 2 个是\n    GeneratorExit irreducible，4 个是 tokenizer/template 差异导致的 edge cases。这作为第 3 个模型验证\n    exception signal 的 cross-architecture robustness。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 第 3 模型达 99.50% 将 effective_model_count 从 2 提升至 3（Qwen 99.83%, CodeLlama\n    99.50%, DeepSeek 99.33% median）。exception_only 在 3 个架构不同的模型上均 >99%（最差情况排除 DeepSeek\n    seed123 outlier），构成 strong cross-model evidence。\n- name: codellama13b_no_trace_seed42\n  plan_id: plan_3rd_model\n  description: CodeLlama-13B-Instruct no_trace baseline\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.7622\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.7378\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.7857\n    n: 1190\n    pass_precision: 0.864\n    pass_recall: 0.79\n    pass_f1: 0.826\n    fail_precision: 0.578\n    fail_recall: 0.694\n    fail_f1: 0.631\n    train_loss: 0.165\n  result_rationale: CodeLlama-13B 的 no_trace baseline 预计 76.2%——介于 Qwen 7B (75.13%)\n    和 DeepSeek (73.36%) 之间偏高。13B 参数量提供略多的 pre-trained knowledge (code pattern recognition\n    from source code alone)，但没有 trace 信息时 ceiling 仍被 'guessing from code structure'\n    限制。CodeLlama 虽然更大，但在 HumanEval/MBPP 这类 competitive programming 题目上其 base code\n    understanding 不必然比 Qwen-7B-Coder (specialized for code) 强很多。Cross-model no_trace\n    gap 维持在 ~2-3pp 范围内（73-76%），确认 baseline capability 跨模型一致。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: no_trace 76.2% 作为 CodeLlama 的 baseline，exception_only lift = 23.3pp（vs\n    Qwen 24.7pp, DeepSeek 26.0pp）。跨模型 trace lift 一致性（23-26pp range）是 trace value 论证的重要支撑。\n- name: codellama13b_vota_seed42\n  plan_id: plan_3rd_model\n  description: CodeLlama-13B-Instruct VOTA SFT\n  expected_results:\n    accuracy: 0.9244\n    accuracy_ci_lower: 0.9092\n    accuracy_ci_upper: 0.9387\n    n: 1190\n    pass_precision: 0.924\n    pass_recall: 0.98\n    pass_f1: 0.951\n    fail_precision: 0.925\n    fail_recall: 0.785\n    fail_f1: 0.849\n    train_loss: 0.058\n    eval_loss: 0.098\n    gap_vs_exception_only: -0.0706\n  result_rationale: CodeLlama-13B VOTA 预计 92.4%——介于 Qwen (99.41%) 和 DeepSeek (84.45%)\n    之间。CodeLlama 的 execution reasoning capability (CRUXEval-I ~45-48%, 介于 Qwen 56.5%\n    和 DeepSeek 39% 之间) 决定了其 VOTA utilization 能力。此外需检查 CodeLlama tokenizer 对 VOTA trace\n    的 token 化效率——如果存在部分截断（类似 DeepSeek），会进一步拉低。VOTA 在 CodeLlama 上 gap vs exception_only\n    为 7.1pp，远大于 Qwen (0.42pp) 但小于 DeepSeek (14.9pp worst-case)。这符合 'VOTA effectiveness\n    is model-capability-dependent, exception signal bypasses this dependency' 叙事。Fail_recall\n    78.5% 反映对 loop compression 信息的利用不完全。\n  tables:\n  - name: 3model_vota_vs_exception_comparison\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - exception_only\n    - VOTA\n    - gap\n    - CRUXEval-I (est.)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B\n      - 99.83%\n      - 99.41%\n      - 0.42pp\n      - 56.5%\n    - - CodeLlama-13B\n      - 99.50%\n      - 92.44%\n      - 7.06pp\n      - ~46%\n    - - DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B\n      - 99.33%*\n      - 84.45%\n      - 14.88pp\n      - 39.0%\n  - name: cross_model_summary_all\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - Qwen-7B\n    - Qwen-1.5B\n    - CodeLlama-13B\n    - DeepSeek-6.7B\n    - cross-model std\n    rows:\n    - - exception_only\n      - 99.83%\n      - 99.83%\n      - 99.50%\n      - 99.33%†\n      - 0.24pp\n    - - VOTA\n      - 99.41%\n      - 97.0%\n      - 92.44%\n      - 84.45%\n      - 6.56pp\n    - - no_trace\n      - 75.13%\n      - 67.31%\n      - 76.22%\n      - 73.36%\n      - 3.86pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: CRUXEval-I score (x) vs VOTA accuracy (y) with regression line\n    — showing correlation, but exception_only as horizontal line at ~99.5%'\n  - 'Radar chart: 4 models × 3 conditions, showing exception_only''s uniform near-ceiling\n    performance'\n  analysis: CodeLlama VOTA 92.4% 提供了 CRUXEval-VOTA 相关性假说的第 3 个数据点（N=3 仍不足以 claim causation，但\n    trend 一致：execution reasoning 越强 → VOTA 利用越好）。关键：exception_only cross-model std\n    = 0.24pp vs VOTA cross-model std = 6.56pp (27x ratio)。这是论文最强的定量 evidence for 'exception\n    signal is the most robust component'。Exception 对 model capability 几乎完全 invariant（99.3-99.8%），而\n    VOTA 高度 model-dependent（84-99%）。Models_where_exception > VOTA = 3/3 (4/4 if count\n    1.5B)。\n","numLines":454,"startLine":1,"totalLines":454}}}
